al Reality Experiences. \n\nVisit the Yulio.com Gallery to see some of the best experiences being created by professional architecture and design firms today - and check back often, we\u2019re publishing new content all the time.\n\nJust click a link from the Gallery or from your designer, follow the simple instructions to connect your headset with your email address and then grab your headset - your virtual reality experience will be downloaded automatically and ready to view!\n", "short_description": "Yulio Viewer is your window into the world of ultra-realistic architecture and interior designer virtual reality experiences.  "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yulio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.yulio.com/terms-and-conditions/", "publisher_name": "Yulio Technologies Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yulio.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2094217837402764"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138831_678242808995773_1433286323_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WPR2FUvMRYEQ7kNvwHdI_nG&_nc_oc=AdqmMeu-KGfXsiNKQsqixEPxFpNULAObzEa_3kvNzlkDzI12NvNLsGdYUj_ec6KqThM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQR3fp46ycmZMB1CDRIH4criE7RjKNgBgTAiPyJDO5ntw&oe=6AFC766F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_